{"meta":{"ph":"slaɪs; NAmE slaɪs","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"a thin flat piece of food that has been cut off a larger piece （切下的食物）薄片，片","ex":[{"s":"Jenna threw the burnt piece into the sink and put in the other slice of bread.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜把烤焦的那片扔进   水池，又放进去另一片面包。"},{"s":"Jenna threw the burnt piece into the  sink and put in the other slice of bread.","src":"2021新高考II卷·A MOTHER’S DAY SURPRISE","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜把烤焦的那片扔进   水池，又放进去另一片面包。"},{"s":"Handing out sliced oranges to bloodthirsty kids can be as exciting as watching your own kid score a goal.","src":"2019全国II卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"给那些“嗜血”的孩子们分发橙子片，可能和看自家孩子进球一样令人兴奋。"},{"s":"If you have a juicer, you can simply feed in frozen bananas and some berries or sliced fruit.","src":"2018全国II卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"如果你有榨汁机，只需投入冷冻香蕉和一些浆果或切片水果。"}]},{"def":"a part or share of sth 部分；份额","ex":[]},{"def":"a kitchen utensil (= tool) that you use to lift and serve pieces of food 锅铲；（餐桌用）小铲","ex":[]},{"def":"a stroke that makes the ball spin to one side rather than going straight ahead 高尔夫球、网球等","ex":[]},{"def":"to cut sth into slices 把 … 切成（薄）片","ex":[{"s":"Jenna found the bread and put two slices into the egg mixture.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜找出面包，把两片放进了蛋液里。"},{"s":"Jenna found the bread and put two slices into the egg mixture.","src":"2021新高考II卷·A MOTHER’S DAY SURPRISE","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜找出面包，把两片放进了蛋液里。"},{"s":"When combined with berries or slices of other fruits, frozen bananas make an excellent base for thick, cooling fruit shakes and low fat “ice cream”.","src":"2018全国II卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"冷冻香蕉与浆果或其他水果片搭配，是制作浓稠、清凉果昔和低脂“冰淇淋”的绝佳基底。"}]},{"def":"to cut sth easily with or as if with a sharp blade 切；割；划","ex":[{"s":"If you eat two slices, you eat two sixths or one third.","src":"人教B1 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"若食二片,则食六分之二或三分之一."},{"s":"Later, I learnt that the most famous food in Shandong is pancake rolls stuffed with sliced Chinese green onions.","src":"人教选必2 U3","cat":"renjiao","t":"后来,我得知山东最有名的食物是煎饼卷,里面塞满切片的中国绿葱."},{"s":"Served plain in thin, white slices, the meat is juicy and salty.","src":"译林选必1 U1","cat":"yilin","t":"服务平原为薄,白色切片,肉质多汁,咸."},{"s":"Slices of garlic can be used to create teeth.","src":"译林选必1 U3","cat":"yilin","t":"大蒜的切片可以用来制造牙齿."}]},{"def":"to hit a ball so that it spins and does not move in the expected direction 削（球）；斜切打","ex":[]},{"def":"to hit the ball so that it flies away in a curve, when you do not mean to 高尔夫球","ex":[]},{"def":"to reduce sth by a large amount 大幅度削减；大量降低","ex":[]}]}